[[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Use tool (1a) to prevent the pulley turning, then unscrew retaining\nbolt (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.001</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the toothed driven pulley.</p><p>3. Remove the front oil seal from its housing.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Removing the oil seal destroys\nit so a new one must be fitted.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046184.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Use tool (1a) to prevent the pulley turning, then unscrew retaining\nbolt (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.001</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the toothed driven pulley.</p><p>3. Remove the front oil seal from its housing.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Removing the oil seal destroys\nit so a new one must be fitted.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046184.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Use the special fitting tool (1a) and fit the new oil seal (1b)\nin the housing on the front cover.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.882.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the driven pulley in the special housing\nin the camshaft.</p><p>2. Use the tool (2a) and tighten the toothed driven pulley fixing\nbolt (2a) to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.001</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>TIMING GEAR DRIVEN PULLEYS</p></td><td><p>M10 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>7</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046185.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Use the special fitting tool (1a) and fit the new oil seal (1b)\nin the housing on the front cover.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.882.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the driven pulley in the special housing\nin the camshaft.</p><p>2. Use the tool (2a) and tighten the toothed driven pulley fixing\nbolt (2a) to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.001</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>TIMING GEAR DRIVEN PULLEYS</p></td><td><p>M10 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>7</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046185.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]